{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:15ba9ffa47d66430","name":"Knight's Armor Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-15ba9ffa47d66430","title":"Knight's Armor Talent Tree","revision":20227,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:26:44Z","sha256":"f3b02a656f3d52cb8fff63473de0b67843e71afa232fc4a9ec0b9dcbe13783dd","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20227","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Knight%27s%20Armor%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-15ba9ffa47d66430","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are a skilled master of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," who knows how to get the most out of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"},".\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Armored Augmentation I"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," Proficient with Armor\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, you may spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to augment your own ability to withstand damage by imbuing the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," you are wearing with ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". This allows you to add your Armor bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"}," until the end of the encounter.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Armored Augmentation II"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Armored Augmentation I"]},", Proficient with Armor\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you use the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Armored Augmentation I"]}," Talent, you also gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"}," equal to 2 x your Armor's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Cortosis Defense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You are adept at using a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cortosis Gauntlet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cortosis_Gauntlet","referenceId":"reference:d6eae42042239792"}," to parry ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," attacks. You gain a +2 bonus when making an opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed"}," melee attack roll against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," attack.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Cortosis Retaliation"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Cortosis Defense"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you successfully use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cortosis Gauntlet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cortosis_Gauntlet","referenceId":"reference:d6eae42042239792"}," to parry an attack made with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},", you may make an immediate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"}," against the attacker.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["This section was titled Armor Mastery in its official source, but has been renamed to distinguish it from the similarly named \"",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor Mastery"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor_Mastery"},".\""]}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Knight Armor Mastery"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," Proficient with Armor\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When calculating your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},", you may add your Heroic Level plus one-half your Armor bonus (rounded down), or your Armor bonus alone, whichever is higher. This Talent counts as both the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Armored Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armored_Defense"}]}," Talent and the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Improved Armored Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improved_Armored_Defense"}]}," Talent for the purposes of prerequisites.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
